# Secrets & Git

- Never write API keys, client secrets, or subscription keys into markdown, rules, code, or commits.
- Use `.env` (gitignored) and `.env.example` (names only).
- Do not `git commit` or `git push` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not update git config. Do not force-push main/master.
